# This repository keeps only the final solution of each practical, README.md and the figures it shows.
# Everything else (briefs, starters, datasets, run outputs, older versions) stays on this machine.
*
!*/
!/practical-*/solution.py
!README.md
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!docs/figures/*.png

# Folders that stay out whatever they hold
.venv/
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
lectures/
data/
.vscode/
.idea/
